  "prefLabel": "Saf-C 512.02 Suspension of Vehicle Registration and Plates",
  "priorExpiration": "2012-03-15",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Saf-C 512.02 Suspension of Vehicle Registration and Plates. Any person who violates the provisions of Saf-C 512.01 and is the owner of the vehicle, or the refusal or failure to submit to weighing occurs at the direction of the owner of the vehicle, the registration and plates of the vehicle shall be suspended after notice and opportunity for a hearing, in accordance with Saf-C 204.19.\n\nSource. #7972, eff 10-17-03 (See Revision Note #1 at chapter heading for Saf-C 500); ss by #9995, INTERIM, eff 9-17-11, EXPIRED: 3-15-12\n\nNew. #10135, eff 5-23-12; ss by #13521, eff 1-13-23 (formerly Saf-C 513.02)",
